    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror Loop tells the deep and unique story of a soldier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Realism</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At TWISTED UNIVERSE, we did our best to make the character hold objects in a very realistic and natural way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We also used the latest game engine, Unreal Engine 5.5, to make the game's lighting, textures, and shadows look their best. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We did our best to create as realistic environments as possible, and to provide a realistic sound experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to make the atmosphere of the game much more realistic, the HUD is not displayed throughout the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactions do not require any menu interaction as we have made zero HUDs specifically to the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror Loop is played with a first person character and we experience the whole story through the eyes of the character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror Loop manipulates the player as little as possible to increase the sense of exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To keep the player tense at every moment of the game, there are enemies chasing the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Language Support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror Loop supports 31 languages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has 31 language support in order to reach as many people as possible and spread it to wide geographies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chapters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game consists of 3 parts in total.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first of these sections is the Home section.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the house section, the player is in a loop, trying to get out of the house by overcoming various difficulties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The second part is the Hospital part.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the hospital section, there is a butcher chasing the player after him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player tries to escape from the hospital by overcoming various difficulties and escaping from the butcher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The third section is the Cave section.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the cave section, the Player learns what is going on with the notes they find around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, there are creatures chasing the player.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror Loop tells the deep and unique story of a soldier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Realism</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At TWISTED UNIVERSE, we did our best to make the character hold objects in a very realistic and natural way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We also used the latest game engine, Unreal Engine 5.5, to make the game's lighting, textures, and shadows look their best. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We did our best to create as realistic environments as possible, and to provide a realistic sound experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to make the atmosphere of the game much more realistic, the HUD is not displayed throughout the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactions do not require any menu interaction as we have made zero HUDs specifically to the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror Loop is played with a first person character and we experience the whole story through the eyes of the character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror Loop manipulates the player as little as possible to increase the sense of exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To keep the player tense at every moment of the game, there are enemies chasing the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Language Support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror Loop supports 31 languages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has 31 language support in order to reach as many people as possible and spread it to wide geographies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chapters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game consists of 3 parts in total.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first of these sections is the Home section.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the house section, the player is in a loop, trying to get out of the house by overcoming various difficulties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The second part is the Hospital part.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the hospital section, there is a butcher chasing the player after him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player tries to escape from the hospital by overcoming various difficulties and escaping from the butcher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The third section is the Cave section.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the cave section, the Player learns what is going on with the notes they find around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, there are creatures chasing the player.</p>",
    "short_description": "Horror Loop, made with a new generation game engine with a deep, impressive and original story, is waiting for you!",
